# ==============================================================================
# NODOX SPD - Endpoints de Consentimientos (Fase Trust Widget)
# ==============================================================================
# Este archivo acumula y prueba cada endpoint creado en la fase de
# consentimientos: Trust Widget, consent logs, pending consents, etc.
#
# Base URL: https://spd-service.nodox.cl
# Los endpoints publicos no requieren autenticacion.
# Los endpoints protegidos requieren cookie de sesion + XSRF-TOKEN.
# ==============================================================================

@company_public_uuid = 39ce42d3-f179-4290-8edf-2eaf01efb82b


# ==============================================================================
# TRUST WIDGET - CONFIGURACION PUBLICA
# ==============================================================================
# Endpoint publico (sin autenticacion) que devuelve la configuracion del
# widget embebible de una empresa. Aplica CORS dinamico + rate limiting.
#
# Variables necesarias:
#   company_public_uuid: UUID v4 publico de la empresa (de la tabla companies)
# ==============================================================================

###
# 1. Obtener configuracion del widget (UUID valido)
#    Esperado: 200 con policy_hash, widget_config, purposes, legal_texts
#    Headers de respuesta: Cache-Control, ETag, Vary
GET https://spd-service.nodox.cl/api/widget/{{company_public_uuid}}/config
Accept: application/json

###
# 2. Preflight CORS (OPTIONS) - origen permitido
#    Esperado: 204 No Content con headers CORS
OPTIONS https://spd-service.nodox.cl/api/widget/{{company_public_uuid}}/config
Origin: https://cliente.nodox.cl
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET
Access-Control-Request-Headers: Content-Type, X-Requested-With

###
# 3. Preflight CORS (OPTIONS) - origen NO permitido
#    Esperado: 403 sin body
OPTIONS https://spd-service.nodox.cl/api/widget/{{company_public_uuid}}/config
Origin: https://sitio-malicioso.cl
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET
Access-Control-Request-Headers: Content-Type, X-Requested-With

###
# 4. UUID invalido (no es UUID v4)
#    Esperado: 400 {"status": false, "message": "...", "data": null}
GET https://spd-service.nodox.cl/api/widget/no-es-un-uuid/config
Accept: application/json

###
# 5. UUID valido pero empresa inexistente
#    Esperado: 404 (firstOrFail)
GET https://spd-service.nodox.cl/api/widget/00000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000000/config
Accept: application/json

###
# 6. Empresa sin politica de cookies publicada
#    Esperado: 404 {"status": false, "message": "Esta empresa no tiene una politica de cookies publicada.", "data": null}
#    Usar un UUID de empresa que exista pero sin cookie_policy publicada
GET https://spd-service.nodox.cl/api/widget/{{company_without_policy_uuid}}/config
Accept: application/json

###
# 7. Rate limiting - exceder limite por IP (5 req/min)
#    Ejecutar 6 veces seguidas. La 6ta debe retornar 429 Too Many Requests
GET https://spd-service.nodox.cl/api/widget/{{company_public_uuid}}/config
Accept: application/json

###
# 8. Rate limiting - exceder limite por IP (repeticion 2)
GET https://spd-service.nodox.cl/api/widget/{{company_public_uuid}}/config
Accept: application/json

###
# 9. Rate limiting - exceder limite por IP (repeticion 3)
GET https://spd-service.nodox.cl/api/widget/{{company_public_uuid}}/config
Accept: application/json

###
# 10. Rate limiting - exceder limite por IP (repeticion 4)
GET https://spd-service.nodox.cl/api/widget/{{company_public_uuid}}/config
Accept: application/json

###
# 11. Rate limiting - exceder limite por IP (repeticion 5)
GET https://spd-service.nodox.cl/api/widget/{{company_public_uuid}}/config
Accept: application/json

###
# 12. Rate limiting - exceder limite por IP (repeticion 6 - debe dar 429)
GET https://spd-service.nodox.cl/api/widget/{{company_public_uuid}}/config
Accept: application/json
